<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">glass-scale-hauberk</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A chainmail vest scaled over in Obelisk lenses. Harder than the chain
beneath, a third of its weight, and the glass throws a little of every
blow back at whoever struck it.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 45)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chain link (x3), iron ingot (x1), obelisk lens (x24)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help blacksmithing</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
